1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,665
To install GameStudio,

2
00:00:04,665 --> 00:00:07,087
start in Blender and open the Edit menu.

3
00:00:07,667 --> 00:00:09,171
Choose Preferences.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,790
In the Preferences window, go to Get Extensions.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,933
Blender asks about online access here.

6
00:00:17,077 --> 00:00:18,865
You don't need it to install from a file,

7
00:00:18,865 --> 00:00:22,041
so leave it, and open the small menu at the top right.

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,336
Choose Install from Disk.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,662
A file browser opens.

10
00:00:26,667 --> 00:00:28,415
Go to your Downloads folder,

11
00:00:28,967 --> 00:00:31,632
select the GameStudio zip you downloaded,

12
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,075
and click Install from Disk.

13
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,152
GameStudio is installed, and it welcomes you

14
00:00:37,152 --> 00:00:39,759
with the three steps from a project to a game.

15
00:00:39,799 --> 00:00:42,023
To try it, click Open Demo.

16
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,558
The demo opens, and GameStudio

17
00:00:44,558 --> 00:00:46,294
sets itself up the first time.

18
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:47,948
It shows what it downloads:

19
00:00:47,948 --> 00:00:50,850
Node.js, the game packages and a game browser,

20
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:54,548
about two hundred and thirty megabytes, once, into its own folder.

21
00:00:54,635 --> 00:00:57,718
Click Allow Online Access and Set Up.

22
00:00:58,367 --> 00:00:59,841
The setup runs in the background,

23
00:00:59,841 --> 00:01:01,659
with its progress in the status bar.

24
00:01:01,699 --> 00:01:03,354
First Node.js,

25
00:01:03,933 --> 00:01:05,623
then the game packages,

26
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:08,193
then the game browser.

27
00:01:08,233 --> 00:01:10,434
You can keep working in Blender meanwhile.

28
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,793
When the status bar is clear, the setup is done.

29
00:01:13,798 --> 00:01:17,287
Open the new GameStudio menu in the top bar to check.

30
00:01:17,867 --> 00:01:19,510
It says the setup is done.

31
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:22,947
GameStudio is installed and ready, with the demo game open.
